#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0332 expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
#note "CHGCAT1N (the operator's TARGET) is not declared. Expansion is seeded from CHGCATy (y=1) and CHGCATyN is synthesised as the absent CHGCAT1N, so the rule DOES execute: all guards are true on every row, and the operator takes the EC-53 fast path (target column index < 0 -> empty BitSet) and flags nothing. No Requirements.Variables gate on this rule, so this is an executed noViolation, not a skip -- the pin on the absent-TARGET fast path."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col AVAL    type=Num
col CHGCAT1 type=Char
---
S1 | 001 | GLUC | 5.0 | IMPROVED
S1 | 002 | GLUC | 5.1 | IMPROVED
S1 | 003 | GLUC | 5.2 | IMPROVED
